==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*jebati}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₃yebʰ-}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|οἴφω}}, {{cog|sa|यभति}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sh|/jěbati/}}
* {{hyphenation|sh|је|ба|ти}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=јѐбати|a=impf}}

# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{ux|sh|јебао сам је ц(иј)ело љето/лето|t=I was fucking her for the whole summer|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|јебао сам је дивље у гузу све до зоре|t=I kept fucking her in the ass until dawn|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|reflexive|vulgar}} to have [[sexual]] [[relationship]]s with somebody
#: {{ux|sh|јебемо се као зечеви кад год стигнемо|t=we fuck like rabbits whenever we can|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|њих двоје се јебу|t=the two of them are having [regular] sex|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar|figuratively}} to [[bother]], [[pest]], [[annoy]]
#: {{ux|sh|немој ме јебати више!|t=stop fucking with me!|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|ц(иј)ело вр(иј)еме док сам возио јебао ме са својим срањима|t=all the way while I was driving he was bothering me with his shit|inline=1}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar|figuratively}} not to [[pay attention]], not to [[give a flying fuck]]
#: {{ux|sh|ја јој причам а она ме не јебе|t=I keep talking to her and she doesn't give a fuck|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|не јебе ме ни 2 посто!|t=[he/she] doesn't give a flying fuck about me|inline=1}}
# {{non-gloss definition|figurative and idiomatic senses}}
#: {{ux|sh|јеби га!|t=fuck it!|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|нек се јебе|t=he/she can go fuck himself/herself|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|(т)ко те јебе!|t=who gives a shit about you!|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|ни(т)ко те не јебе|t=nobody gives a shit about you|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|можеш га/се јебати|t=there is nothing you can do|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|јебе ми се|t=I don't give a crap|inline=1}}

